           panels never share row-key state.
+        hide_bar_values: for a bar row, suppress the "val/max" text unless
+          the mouse is currently over that specific row — used by compact
+          roster panels (squad/fighter HUDs) where a row is just a name and
+          two colour-coded bars, with the exact numbers a hover away rather
+          than always on screen. Off by default so every other bar-row
+          panel (Target, Ship Vitals, …) is unaffected.

