+                        # Value text draws LAST — after the bar fill/frame
+                        # — so it's always on top. For a labelled row this
+                        # sits on its own text line above the bar and
+                        # never overlapped anyway; for a blank-label
+                        # (compact roster) row the value shares the bar's
+                        # own row, so drawing it after the bar is what
+                        # keeps it legible instead of getting painted over.
